## kenken-4-3: KenKen solver rewritten to the world conventions (world conventions, no environment)
## Shared Soar library (Soar/soar-library, v2.32); the path assumes this folder is in Tasks/Families/<family>/world/<variant>
pushd "../../../../../Soar/soar-library"
source soar-library.soar
popd

## Settings kept from the original program
chunk always
chunk add-osk on
chunk allow-local-negations off
multi-attributes object 121
multi-attributes cand 5
multi-attributes in-tuple 20
multi-attributes uses-cand 5

source kenken-rules.soar
source initialize-kenken.soar
source print-row.soar
